<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/19th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Langensalza (1866)</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1866">1866</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a> · Part of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austro-prussian-war">Austro-Prussian War</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Langensalza was fought on 27 June 1866 in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/thuringia">Thuringia</a> during the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austro-prussian-war">Austro-Prussian War</a>. The Hanoverian army of King <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/george-v">George V</a> defeated a Prussian force, but surrounded by larger Prussian armies it surrendered two days later. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-prussia">Prussia</a> then annexed the Kingdom of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hanover">Hanover</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-langensalza-1866.jpg" alt="Battle of Langensalza (1866)" width="320" height="238" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Georg von Boddien (+1928) · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Battle_of_Langensalza.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
